Attribute as:

    Role morphs, https://github.com/mercurialsolo/role-morphs, CC BY 4.0

Two notes on what you are attributing.

Job-posting records under data/postings/ are factual metadata about publicly
advertised roles: title, team, location, identifier, and the employer's own
URL. Posting bodies are not collected and are not covered here; that text
remains the employer's. Follow the URL to read it where they published it.

Rows in role-morphs.json carry an evidence_type. Please carry it with them. A
row graded "Argued only" is an argument, not a finding, and reproducing it
without its grade would misrepresent the dataset.
